; Breakage 04a: Attribute typo `:metod` instead of `:method` on `|checked`
; Translator passes unknown attributes straight into the OCaml record literal!
; Expected: `ocamlc` reports `Unbound record field metod` at exact .ud line!

|document[broken-04a]
  :context verisectorium

  |piece[p1].accepted Some claim
    :kind    claim
    :author  "Alice"
    :version 1
    Claim body.

  |checked :by "Bob" :about @[p1] :version 1 :metod "review" :outcome confirmed :at "2026-11-24"
